command to install python on windows from terminal:
[Net.ServicePointManager]::SecurityProtocol = [Net.SecurityProtocolType]::Tls12;
Invoke-WebRequest "https://www.python.org/ftp/python/3.12.2/python-3.12.2-amd64.exe" -OutFile python.exe

command to pull github from terminal
Invoke-webRequest -Uri "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Christian-K9/Orthrus/main/Windows/script.py" -Headers @{ "User-Agent" = "Mozilla/5.0" } -OutFile "script.py"

command to run script from terminal
powershell.exe -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\setup.ps1
